For ICPay, keep the staking system **simple, auditable, and modular**. Don't duplicate reward logic across functions. A single reward engine should be reused everywhere.

# Folder Structure

```text
backend/
└── src/
    ├── api/
    │   └── v1/
    │       └── stake.mo
    │
    ├── models/
    │   ├── Stake.mo
    │   └── StakePlan.mo
    │
    ├── services/
    │   ├── StakeService.mo
    │   ├── RewardService.mo
    │   └── Validation.mo
    │
    ├── utils/
    │   ├── Time.mo
    │   └── Math.mo
    │
    └── storage/
        └── StakeStore.mo
```

No reward calculations should exist inside `stake.mo`.

