## Stake

```motoko
public type Stake = {

    id : Nat;

    userId : Principal;

    amount : Nat;

    planId : Nat8;

    apr : Float;

    startedAt : Int;

    unlockAt : Int;

    claimedReward : Nat;

    active : Bool;
};
```

Notice

Never store

```
pendingReward
```

Always calculate it.

