# Reward Engine

Only ONE function.

```motoko
calculateReward(
    amount,
    apr,
    startedAt,
    now,
    claimedReward
)
```

Everything calls this.

* Dashboard
* Claim
* Unstake
* API

Never duplicate reward calculations.

